#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Hodder and Stoughton’s Christmas List of Novels [advertisement]|magazine=[[w:The Bookman (London)|The Bookman]]|location=London; New York, N.Y.|publisher=[[w:Hodder & Stoughton|Hodder and Stoughton]]{{nb...|St. Paul’s House, Warwick Square, London, E.C. Thirty-eight West Thirty-second Street, New York. Hodder & Stoughton, Limited, 17 Wilton Avenue, Toronto.}}|month=December|year=1915|volume=XLIX|issue=291|page=xv|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=ZKhCAQAAMAAJ&pg=RA2-PR15|column=4|oclc=781608980|passage=The most vivacious, sparkling, entertaining piece of comedy you are likely to come across in a '''month of Sundays'''.}}
